Bharata hears Guha unwelcome tidings --- Bharata faints like pierced elephant --- Śatrughna embraces wailing Bharata --- Grieving mothers surround fallen Bharata --- Kausalyā questions Bharata about Rāma party --- Bharata asks Guha about Rāma night --- Guha tells Rāma refusing offered food --- Rāma fasts on Lakṣmaṇa fetched water --- Rāma and Sītā sleep on grass bed --- Lakṣmaṇa and Guha guard bow in hand
